    A tuple of `N+1` dimensional tensors `(codepoints, start_offsets)`.

    * `codepoints` is an `int32` tensor with shape `[D1...DN, (num_chars)]`.
    * `offsets` is an `int64` tensor with shape `[D1...DN, (num_chars)]`.

